# Build output (static binaries + manifest), produced by build.sh.
# The prebuilt dist IS committed (tracked via !dist/ below) so:
#   1. electron-builder's extraResources can ship it with the packaged app.
#   2. Dev mode can find the binaries at <repo>/remote-helper/dist without
#      requiring a local Go toolchain.
# Regenerate with: cd remote-helper && ./build.sh
!/dist/
/dist/*.tmp
